# Chromium's OS libraries on Ubuntu 24.04 (noble), the set
# `playwright install --with-deps chromium` would apt-install, so a job that
# pre-provisions them can run the browser download alone (`--only-shell`, no
# --with-deps) and skip an apt-get update and install in every job.
#
# Five are t64-suffixed on noble; the plain names have no candidate there.
# libnss3, libnspr4, libdrm2 and libxkbcommon0 already arrive with Lima's
# Ubuntu image and need no entry (a trimmed image would).
libatk1.0-0t64
libatk-bridge2.0-0t64
libcups2t64
libatspi2.0-0t64
libasound2t64
libxcomposite1
libxdamage1
libxfixes3
libxrandr2
libgbm1
libpango-1.0-0
libcairo2
